@startuml MacroManagerCommunicationDiagram
top to bottom direction
skinparam linetype ortho

object "user : User" as User
object "window : WebcamWindow" as Window
object "scan : ScanController" as Scan
object "cam : CameraService" as Cam
object "infer : YoloInferenceService" as Infer

User --> Window : 1: scanCandyItem()
Window --> Scan : 1.1: requestScan()
Scan --> Cam : 1.2: getFrame()
Cam --> Scan : 1.3: frame
Scan --> Infer : 1.4: detect(frame)
Infer --> Scan : 1.5: detections

Scan --> Window : 1.6a [recognized] : showDetection(label, confidence)
Scan --> Window : 1.6b [not recognized] : showNotRecognized()

@enduml